  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to higher education for indigenous peoples, continuation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Zugang zur Hochschulbildung f&#xfc;r Indigene, Fortf&#xfc;hrung</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project in which scholarships are awarded to socially committed young indigenous people who are supported by an integrated accompanying programme until the end of their studies in order to successfully complete their university studies.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Projekt, in dem Stipendien an sozial engagierte, junge Indigene vergeben werden, die mit einem ganzheitlichen Studienbegleitprogramm bis zum Studienende unterst&#xfc;tzt werden, um ihren Hochschulabschluss erfolgreich zu erreichen.</narrative>
  </description>
